schema: "0.3"
id: echo-of-manifestation-creature-shadow-archer
type: image
service: gemini

prompt:
  text: >
    Dark fantasy concept art of a Shadow Archer — a chimera spawned as the dark echo of
    the player's ranged transmutations. The creature is tall and spindly, its limbs
    impossibly elongated — arms like stilts, legs like stilts, a narrow torso that seems
    purely structural. It stands on an elevated position — a broken pillar or ledge —
    looking down at an unseen target below. Its bow is formed from its own shadow-substance,
    the string a line of condensed darkness. Shadow-bolts — arrows made of crystallized
    shadow with amber cores — are nocked and ready, with additional bolts floating in a
    halo around the creature's upper body, suggesting they track their targets
    independently. Multiple eyes dot the creature's head and shoulders — seven or eight
    eyes of varying sizes, all amber, all watching different directions simultaneously.
    The creature's body shows fragments of the original transmuted item: wood grain in
    the bow-arm, string texture in the torso, as if the essence bow tried to build a body
    to wield itself. The pose is coiled readiness — not attacking yet but about to, weight
    shifted onto the back leg, bow arm fully extended. Background is deep indigo void with
    faint vertical lines suggesting architectural ruins. Painterly style, atmospheric
    lighting from the amber eyes and arrow cores.
  negative: "bright, cheerful, cartoon, anime, clean magic, elf archer, generic ranger, human proportions, symmetrical, normal eyes, colorful palette, low detail, flat shading, friendly"

output:
  formats:
    - format: png
  dimensions:
    width: 1024
    height: 1536
    aspect_ratio: "2:3"

tags: [creature, chimera, enemy, shadow-archer, ranged-echo, concept-art, dark-fantasy]
